window.EN={"1":"A day behind Dorias and his men, Leif and the others, their preparations finally complete,","2":"were just about to begin their advance on Ulster.","3":"At that moment, an unexpected report was brought from Dorias's unit, which had gone ahead.","4":"It announced the beginning of the road of hardship that Leif and his people would come to walk.","5":"August, it seems everyone is assembled. Then we march for Ulster.","6":"Prince, someone has come to the castle. Most likely one of Lord Dorias's men...","7":"Prince Leif! ...It is bitter news...","8":"What's wrong? What happened?","9":"We were hit by the imperial army's counterattack, and our unit was... wiped out...","10":"What!? Where is Dorias? Where is he?","11":"Lord Dorias... to aid our retreat...","12":"cut into the enemy army himself... and m-met... a bitter end...","13":"!! ......","14":"All because our strength fell short... Forgive us!","15":"Impossible... such a thing...","16":"Prince, our allies are retreating this way. Unless we hurry, they cannot escape annihilation. Cover them...","17":"...Impossible... no...","18":"Prince! Pull yourself together!","19":"If we let our allies be wiped out like this, Lord Dorias's sacrifice will be in vain! Rescue as many soldiers as possible!","20":"...You maggots. Have you learned the might of my empire!","21":"Wolf, I leave the rest to you. On the name of House Friege, retake Leonster without fail!","22":"Sir, without fail!!","23":"Many citizens have died... But as long as I am here, I will not let Ulster perish...","24":"I have a duty to protect my subordinates' lives. But is this truly right...","25":"Father Sleuf, please tell me. What should I do...","26":"Conomor, stop this now!","27":"Princess Miranda!? Why are you in a place like this!","28":"I was saved by Prince Leif. In answer to my plea, he tried to save Ulster.","29":"For that he lost many soldiers and even a precious close retainer.","30":"And yet, what are you doing!","31":"With the elite army of Ulster in your hands, you've sunk to being the Empire's lapdog. What on earth are you thinking!","32":"Yes... I have no excuse...","33":"The enemy is not Leonster. The Empire is our hated enemy.","34":"Order the knights under your command: aid the Leonster army's retreat!","35":"From this moment, all of Ulster as a nation joins Prince Leif's Liberation Army of northern Thracia!","36":"Understood. Then, at once.","37":"Hear this, all the army of Ulster!","38":"From this moment we join the Liberation Army. Knights, aid the Leonster army with all your strength!","39":"We shall go into exile in Leonster and aim to retake our homeland, Ulster.","40":"Know that this is the order of our princess, Princess Miranda!","41":"Lady Amalda, please lower your sword. It is I, Sleuf.","42":"Father Sleuf. Why have you come to a place like this?","43":"I came for you. Prince Leif's Liberation Army is waiting for you.","44":"You tell me to betray my country?","45":"Father Sleuf, that is impossible. If I could do that, I would not be suffering so.","46":"Lady Amalda, a country is surely not the private property of kings and nobles.","47":"When it is headed in the wrong direction, setting it right is also a knight's duty.","48":"Fearing the stigma of traitor, do you mean to overlook your country's wrongs?","49":"It is not that, but... only, when I think what will become of my subordinates...","50":"That is for them to decide. You should be honest with your own heart.","51":"I understand... Father Sleuf, I will fight alongside the Liberation Army.","52":"To take back the stolen children! That is my wish!!","53":"Is it true the Leonster army lost? Will it go back to the age of the Empire again...","54":"What, you won't let that happen? How reassuring.","55":"I'll give you this holy water, so please put it to use.","56":"I wonder if this area will become a battlefield again. Oh, how awful, how awful.","57":"You're with the Leonster army, aren't you? I'll give you this silver sword, so do something about it.","58":"I hear the rebel army was beaten at Ulster. Are you all right?","59":"Take this Killer Lance. I think it's pretty easy to use.","60":"What, for people who say they'll save Thracia, you look pretty sluggish.","61":"I'll give you this Speed Ring, so get a bit quicker. Enough to startle your opponents.","62":"What, you're fighting to liberate this Thracia?","63":"An admirable spirit. Yes, I like it. I'll give you this holy water.","64":"Many in the imperial army use magic. It's sure to come in handy.","65":"They say the imperial army is closing in with tremendous force?","66":"There must be many wounded soldiers, too.","67":"This is a Heal staff. Please use it.","68":"So the imperial army is strong after all... But don't you lose. You people are our hope.","69":"I know, I'll give you this M Up staff. Use it and you'll be able to fight at more of an advantage.","70":"Your comrades are all covered in wounds.","71":"I'll give you this Heal staff, so hurry and patch them up.","72":"Um... if you'd like, please use this spellbook.","73":"I'm told it's a book of wind magic called Wind, or something...","74":"So... well... please protect us.","75":"It appears the Empire's all-out counterattack has begun.","76":"At this rate we cannot hold them off. Let us retreat inside the castle for now.","77":"August, this is my mistake. I was a fool... It's as good as if I killed Dorias myself...","78":"This is no time to be saying such things.","79":"Apologize to Lord Dorias after you have defended this Leonster to the end.","80":"In any case, for now you must endure.","81":"You're right...","82":"Do not be so downcast. It is not all bad news.","83":"This is only a rumor, but a great revolt has broken out in the Kingdom of Isaach to the east, and they are fighting well against the Empire.","84":"Can you guess who the leader of that rebel army is?","85":"If it's Isaach, it must be Prince Shannan? I've heard of him from Finn.","86":"He has the finest skill as a swordsman, is loved by the people, and is a wonderful man, they say...","87":"A far cry from me...","88":"Naturally, Prince Shannan should be there too, but the leader is someone else.","89":"What...?","90":"Lord Seliph of Chalphy... The Isaachians hail him as Grannvale's Prince of Light.","91":"Lord Seliph!? ...Is that true!","92":"Yes.","93":"Lord Seliph's father was your uncle as well, Prince.","94":"The paladin Sigurd... Until about ten years ago he was treated as a traitor, yet now he is hugely popular.","95":"He saw through the Emperor's ambition early and fought to save the world, but met an untimely death...","96":"This tale, spread by bards, has spread among the people suffering under the Empire's tyranny, and he has now become a legendary hero.","97":"And that hero's child is bravely trying to carry on his father's will...","98":"The people must be glad. For the young lord's sake they would not shrink even from death. It is, in short, the perfect scenario.","99":"...... What on earth are you trying to say?","100":"That Lord Seliph's fame, at the least, is not due to his own strength.","101":"The age demands a hero. In answer to that demand, someone is trying to fashion the young lord into a hero.","102":"A hero is not something one becomes by one's own will; it is something made as need requires.","103":"Then was I made by you, August?","104":"You may think of it that way. Prince, let me say this plainly on this occasion.","105":"Lord Dorias once lost an arm to save you, Prince.","106":"And now once more, he took your place and ended his life.","107":"Why did things come to that?","108":"Why are you kept alive at such cost? Why are you called a hero for killing people?","109":"Please think hard on the meaning of that...","110":"You say you have business with the prince, but the prince wishes to see no one at present.","111":"I will hear it in his place.","112":"We are people who fled from Ulster.","113":"We were being chased by imperial soldiers and in danger when the Leonster army saved us.","114":"So in thanks, we wished to give this Knight Proof...","115":"...I have indeed received it. I will report it to the prince.","116":"Thank you kindly.","117":"Do you, too, wish to fall prey to my blade!","118":"Gwah... It... can't be...","119":"Pull your soldiers back at once! There is no need to throw lives away!","120":"This is fine... For me... covered in blood... an unsightly end is what's fitting...","121":"What on earth am I doing...","122":"This, too, is for Ulster. Forgive me!","123":"May Ulster... rise... once again...","124":"To suffer the humiliation of captivity... But for now I must live..."};
